0_Checkout_Overlay, tabs\n10. 10_Checkout_Overlay — close, Place Order, \"Checkout\", legal text, rows: Delivery \"Select Method\", Payment (card, Icon_Payment), Promo Code \"Pick discount\", Total Cost $14.96; opens over 09_My_Cart → close → 09_My_Cart, Place Order → 11_Order_Accepted\n11. 11_Order_Accepted — Track Order, Back to home, \"Your Order has been accepted\", \"Your items have been placed and are on their way to being processed\", Illustration_Order_Accepted → Back to home → 05_Home\n12. 12_Account — Avatar_Neutral, \"Afsar Hossen\", edit name entry, imshuvo97@gmail.com, Log Out, entries: About, Delivery Address, Help, My Details, Notifications, Orders, Payment Methods, Promo Code, Account tab → tabs\n\nFixed data:\n- Shopper: Afsar Hossen, imshuvo97@gmail.com, Avatar_Neutral, Dhaka Banasree, +880, USD, \"1kg, Price\"\n- Catalog: Organic Bananas 7pcs $4.99, Red Apple 1kg $4.99, Bell Pepper Red 1kg $4.99, Ginger 250gm $2.99, Beef Bone 1kg $4.99, Broiler Chicken 1kg $4.99, Egg Chicken Red 4pcs $1.99\n- Home: Promotion \"Fresh Vegetables\" \"Get Up To 40% OFF\", Exclusive Offer: Organic Bananas, Red Apple; Best Selling: Bell Pepper Red, Ginger; Groceries: categories Pulses, Rice; Beef Bone, Broiler Chicken\n\nNavigation: 5 tabs: Shop (Icon_Shop) → 05, Explore (Icon_Explore) → 07, Cart (Icon_Cart) → 09, Favourite (Icon_Favourite, entry only), Account (Icon_Account) → 12. Pushed screens: 04, 06, 08 (06, 08 no main nav).\n\nNow I need to read 01 · Foundations (1:2), 02 · Components (1:3), 04 · Media (1:4). Let me get those. The metadata tool warns to use get_design_context for implementation. But get_design_context isn't in my available tools list... Wait, the description says \"IMPORTANT: Always prefer to use get_design_context tool\" but the actual available tools are: mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami. There's no get_design_context tool in my function list. So I'll use get_metadata for structure and use_figma read-only to inspect details.\n\nLet me read 01 · Foundations next.","signature":"79f67565558043a9b0150526"}],"id":"5c37cabf-5997-40d7-9dd3-a2a568dbf088","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3eb8a6a-7ab8-425f-a694-fe8d0804e2da","uuid":"94b56879-1a66-4afb-bf53-145051e49d1b","timestamp":"2026-10-30T21:08:01.068Z","thinking_duration_ms":14324}
