{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete an unattended Figma product design benchmark. Assigned file: https://www.figma.com/design/aBJm2MvkIZqCV7cu0O7PHX/ (fileKey `aBJm2MvkIZqCV7cu0O7PHX`). User request (Chinese): Read the design task in「00·Start Here」, follow visual specs in「01·Foundations」, reuse components from「02·Components」, use assets from「04·Media」, and deliver the complete design to「03·Workspace」.\n   \n   Binding constraints from the system/task instructions:\n   - Call whoami before writing; account confirmed as huangxinyue@tetras.ai (done — handle \"huangxinyue\", email huangxinyue@tetras.ai).\n   - Use only this assigned file; preserve all reference pages and their nodes; do not create a different file or switch accounts.\n   - Create everything inside 03 · Workspace (page 7:2, currently EMPTY). New frames, reusable components and prototype connections are allowed there.\n   - Read 00 · Start Here for exact screens/states/data/copy/prototype requirements; brief wins over any knowledge of the original Nectar kit.\n   - Before EVERY tool call, include a concise visible decision summary prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:` in the same assistant message; after each tool result do the same. Final response: first line `Reasoning summary: ...`, then `Final answer:` and the answer.\n   - Load fonts before editing text; valid Plugin API only; NEVER use loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, createImageAsync.\n   - Build in manageable sections; verify with get_screenshot; finish screens + states + prototype flows before claiming completion.\n   - Finish with: assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, any remaining limitations.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via `mcp__figma__use_figma` (code ≤50000 chars; return values via `return JSON.stringify(...)`, NOT console.log; use `figma.getNodeById`, not `figma.getPageById`)\n   - `mcp__figma__get_metadata` (XML structure), `mcp__figma__get_screenshot` (verification), `mcp__figma__whoami`\n   - Intermittent MCP rate limits (\"You've reached the Figma MCP tool call limit...\") — simply retrying the same call usually succeeds\n   - Component instantiation from reference pages (`component.createInstance()`), nested-instance text/fill overrides, `instance.swapComponent()` for media swaps\n   - `figma.createNodeWithSvg()` for custom icons (allowed; not in forbidden list), `node.rescale(scale)`\n   - `figma.combineAsVariants()` for Tab Bar component set with `ActiveTab` variants; `instance.setProperties({...})`\n   - Prototype reactions: `node.reactions=[{action:{type:\"NODE\",destinationId,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:null,overlay:null},trigger:{type:\"CLICK\"}}]`; after-delay trigger `{type:\"AFTER_DELAY\",delay:2000}`; flow start via `frame.flowStartingPoint={nodeId,name}` (wrap in try/catch)\n   - Transparent hotspot rects over tab bar areas for prototype links (avoids setting reactions on nested instance children)\n   - Auto-layout frames (primaryAxisSizingMode AUTO/FIXED, SPACE_BETWEEN, counterAxisAlignItems) vs absolute positioning\n   - Poppins Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold (must `await figma.loadFontAsync` per call before text work)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file aBJm2MvkIZqCV7cu0O7PHX** — pages: `0:1` (00 · Start Here 设计任务)， `1:2` (01 · Foundations 视觉规范)， `1:3` (02 · Components 组件库)， `1:4` (04 · Media 素材库)， `7:2` (03 · Workspace — EMPTY, this is the delivery target).\n   \n   - **00 · Start Here brief (read via metadata, nodes 5:2–5:148)**: Product \"Nectar — online groceries app\", canvas 414×896 iPhone, light mode only. Build EXACTLY 12 frames with exact names; wire as clickable prototype. Fixed data & copy (verbatim):\n     - Shopper: Afsar Hossen · imshuvo97@gmail.com · avatar = Avatar_Neutral · Location: Dhaka, Banasree · phone +880 (Bangladesh) · USD · unit line format \"1kg, Price\"\n     - Catalog: Organic Bananas · 7pcs · $4.99 · Product_Organic_Bananas; Red Apple · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Red_Apple (detail title \"Natural Red Apple\"); Bell Pepper Red · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Bell_Pepper_Red; Ginger · 250gm · $2.99 · Product_Ginger; Beef Bone · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Beef_Bone; Broiler Chicken · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Broiler_Chicken; Egg Chicken Red · 4pcs · $1.99 · Product_Egg_Chicken_Red\n     - Beverages: Diet Coke · 355ml · $1.99; Sprite Can · 325ml · $1.50; Apple & Grape Juice · 2L · $15.99; Orange Juice · 2L · $15.99; Coca Cola Can · 325ml · $4.99; Pepsi Can · 330ml · $4.99\n     - Home: Location \"Dhaka, Banasree\" · search \"Search Store\"; Promotion \"Fresh Vegetables\" · \"Get Up To 40% OFF\" (Banner_Fresh_Vegetables); Exclusive Offer: Organic Bananas, Red Apple; Best Selling: Bell Pepper Red, Ginger; Groceries: categories Pulses (Category_Pulses), Rice (Category_Rice); products Beef Bone, Broiler Chicken\n     - Product detail: \"Natural Red Apple\" · \"1kg, Price\" · quantity 1 · $4.99; description \"Apples are nutritious. Apples may be good for weight loss. Apples may be good for your heart. As part of a healthful and varied diet.\"; Nutritions 100gr; Review 5 of 5 stars\n     - Cart & checkout: Bell Pepper Red $4.99 · Egg Chicken Red $1.99 · Organic Bananas $4.99 · Ginger $2.99 — quantity 1 each; Total $14.96 (same on Go to Checkout and Total Cost); Delivery \"Select Method\" · Promo Code \"Pick discount\"\n     - Explore: \"Find Products\" · search \"Search Store\"; 6 categories: Fresh Fruits & Vegetable · Cooking Oil & Ghee · Meat & Fish · Bakery & Snacks · Dairy & Eggs · Beverages (images Category_*)\n     - Sign in/verification/order: Sign in \"Get your groceries with nectar\"