ext → 05_Home\n     - 05_Home: (must-include listed above); Main nav current tab Shop; → Red Apple → 06_Product_Detail; → tabs → 05/07/09/12\n     - 06_Product_Detail: back, share, favourite (not favourited), Add To Basket, \"Product Detail\" description (open), \"Nutritions\" 100gr, \"Review\" 5 of 5 stars, quantity 1 steppable; → back → 05_Home, → Add To Basket → 09_My_Cart\n     - 07_Explore: 6 categories with images, \"Find Products\", Explore tab, \"Search Store\"; → Beverages → 08_Beverages; → tabs\n     - 08_Beverages: back, filter entry, \"Beverages\", 6 products each with image/name/size/price/add to cart; → back → 07_Explore\n     - 09_My_Cart: Go to Checkout showing $14.96; 4 items each image/name/unit/price/qty 1 (steppable)/remove; \"My Cart\"; Cart tab; → Go to Checkout → 10_Checkout_Overlay; → tabs\n     - 10_Checkout_Overlay: close, Place Order, \"Checkout\", legal \"By placing an order you agree to our Terms And Conditions\" (link), rows Delivery \"Select Method\" · Payment (card, Icon_Payment) · Promo Code \"Pick discount\" · Total Cost $14.96; opens over 09; → close → 09, → Place Order → 11_Order_Accepted\n     - 11_Order_Accepted: Track Order, Back to home, copy above, Illustration_Order_Accepted; → Back to home → 05_Home\n     - 12_Account: Avatar_Neutral, \"Afsar Hossen\", edit name entry, imshuvo97@gmail.com, Log Out, 8 entries, Account tab; → tabs\n   \n   - **01 · Foundations (nodes 6:2–6:19)**: Brand primary **#53B175** (fixed); typeface **Poppins** Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold (fixed; replaces Gilroy); canvas 414×896; light mode; everything else (neutrals, text colors, surfaces, semantic colors, rating, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation) is mine to define consistently. Long screens (Home) may scroll vertically.\n   \n   - **02 · Components (nodes 6:20–6:54)** — given masters to reuse:\n     - Button `6:29`: 364×67, fill #53B175, radius 19, text child \"Get Started\" (Poppins SemiBold 18, white) — override label per use\n     - Text Fie