n_Notifications `4:148` (22×24), Icon_Orders `4:151` (22×24), Icon_Payment `4:154` (24×17), Icon_Promo `4:157`, Icon_Search `4:160`, Icon_Shop `4:163`.\n   \n   - **Read-only inspection (use_figma)**: confirmed workspace `7:2` has zero children; component inventory above; detailed Button/TextField/StatusBar/HomeIndicator structure.\n   \n   - **Design system decisions (mine)**: Colors: brand `#53B175`, dark text `#181725`, secondary `#7C7C7C`, light/disabled `#B1B1B1`, border `#E2E2E2`, surface `#F2F3F2`, white, offer/rating orange `#F3603F`, FB blue `#1877F2`, scrim black 40%. Type: Poppins (28/26/24 Bold, 20 SemiBold titles, 18 SemiBold buttons, 17/16/15 Medium/Regular body, 14 captions, 12/11 small). Spacing 24 margins, gaps 12–16; radii 19 buttons / 18 cards / 15 search / 24 sheet; shadows 0,4,16,6% cards and 0,2,10,12% circles.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Intermittent MCP rate limit** (\"You've reached the Figma MCP tool call limit for your Full seat on the Enterprise plan\"): hit ~every other call; fix = simply retry the identical call, which then succeeds. Expect this pattern on every subsequent call.\n   - **`figma.getPageById: no such property`**: not a real API; fixed by using `figma.getNodeById(\"7:2\")`.\n   - **\"Code executed with no return value\"**: `console.log(JSON.stringify(out))` doesn't surface output; fixed by `return JSON.stringify(out);` as the last statement.\n   - **Last use_figma call failed with \"[Tool result missing due to internal error]\"**: the tool input was truncated (code parameter cut off mid-way, visible in `__unparsedToolInput` ending mid-line at \"if\"). Nothing was executed — workspace still empty. Fix going forward: split large build scripts into SMALLER use_figma calls (~6–9k chars each) and re-issue; do not send ~14k-char single calls.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Mapped the complete brief, foundations, components, and all 52 media component masters with IDs and dimensions.\n   - Designed a full design system (tokens a