gin API.\n\nBut to be safe, maybe overlay the flag/prefix directly on f3 instead of inside pf. Since links: PhoneField → 04. I'll set reaction on the Text Field instance itself. Overlays positioned on f3 at same coords. Safer. Let me do that:\n\n```js\nconst fl=mediaInst(\"Flag_Bangladesh\",f3);fl.resize(30,18);fl.x=24;fl.y=505;\nconst ph=txt(\"+880\",16,\"Medium\",C.dark);f3.appendChild(ph);ph.x=64;ph.y=503;\nconst dv3=figma.createRectangle();f3.appendChild(dv3);dv3.resize(1,24);dv3.fills=[F(C.border)];dv3.x=116;dv3.y=502;\n```\npf at (24,470); label ~y470..494; input y494..534; underline at y514 (470+24+40=534? Actually input frame 364×40 at y24 → 494..534, underline at bottom y533). Text vertically centered in input: ~y503. Flag y505. OK good.\n\n\"Or connect with social media\":\n```js\nconst om=txt(\"Or connect with social media\",14,\"Medium\",C.gray);f3.appendChild(om);om.x=(414-om.width)/2;om.y=618;\nconst l1=figma.createRectangle();f3.appendChild(l1);l1.resize(90,1);l1.fills=[F(C.border)];l1.x=24;l1.y=618+om.height/2;\nconst l2=...x=300\n```\nText width ~200 → hairlines 24..~107 and ~307..390. I'll compute from om.width: l1.x=24, width=(414-om.width)/2-24-16; l2.x=(414+om.width)/2+16, width same.\n\n```js\nconst soG=MASTER[\"Social Button\"].createInstance();f3.appendChild(soG);soG.x=25;soG.y=664;soG.name=\"Btn/Google\";\nconst soF=MASTER[\"Social Button\"].createInstance();f3.appendChild(soF);soF.x=25;soF.y=747;soF.name=\"Btn/Facebook\";\nconst flbl=soF.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Label\");flbl.characters=\"Continue with Facebook\";\nconst ficon=soF.findOne(n=>n.name===\"SocialIcon\");ficon.swapComponent(MASTER[\"Icon_Facebook_White\"]);recolor(ficon,\"#1877F2\");\nhomeInd(f3,false,false);\n```\n\nWait recolor of swapped instance: after swap, children are facebook icon vectors (white) → recolor to #1877F2. Good. Also Google instance label default \"Continue with Google\" matches.\n\nHmm — Social Button component's SocialIcon is an instance of Icon_Google_White (nested instance). swapComponent on nested instance works. Good.\n\n**04_Verification** (1542,0):\n```js\nconst f4=mkFrame(\"04_Verification\",1542,0,414,896,C.white);\nstatusBar(f4,false,false);\nconst bk=MASTER[\"Circle Button\"].createInstance();f4.appendChild(bk);bk.x=24;bk.y=64;bk.name=\"Btn/Back\";\nconst bi=svgI(\"M15 5l-7 7 7 7\",18,C.dark);f4.appendChild(bi);bi.x=24+(44-bi.width)/2;bi.y=64+(44-bi.height)/2;\nconst t4=txt(\"Enter your 4-digit code\",24,\"SemiBold\",C.dark,300);f4.appendChild(t4);t4.x=24;t4.y=140;\nconst codeI=MASTER[\"Code Input\"].createInstance();f4.appendChild(codeI);codeI.x=24;codeI.y=210;codeI.name=\"CodeInput\";\nconst rs=txt(\"Resend Code\",18,\"SemiBold\",C.brand);f4.appendChild(rs);rs.x=24;rs.y=790;rs.name=\"Btn/Resend\";\nconst nx=figma.createFrame();f4.appendChild(nx);nx.resize(67,67);nx.cornerRadius=33.5;nx.fills=[F(C.brand)];nx.x=323;nx.y=779;nx.name=\"Btn/Next\";\nconst ni=svgI(\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\",20,\"#FFFFFF\");nx.appendChild(ni);ni.x=(67-ni.width)/2;ni.y=(67-ni.height)/2;\nhomeInd(f4,false,false);\n```\n\nWait, Circle Button shadow + chevron centered: chevron 18px at x=24+13=37, y=64+13=77. Good.\n\nAlso \"Code\" label inside Code Input instance — default \"Code\" gray — matches brief. \n\ny positions: Resend at 790 (height ~27) → 817; Next at 779..846; HI at 862. OK.\n\nReturn ids of frames: {f1:f1.id,...}.\n\nChar count for Call 2: ~5.5k. OK.\n\nCall 3: 05_Home (414×1348):\n\n```js\nconst f5=mkFrame(\"05_Home\",0,1000,414,1348,C.white);\nstatusBar(f5,false,false);\nconst ct=mediaInst(\"Nectar_Carrot\",f5);fit? native 29×34; center y56: ct.x=(414-29)/2;ct.y=56;\nconst loc=txt(\"Dhaka, Banasree\",18,\"Medium\",C.dark);f5.appendChild(loc);loc.x=(414-loc.width)/2;loc.y=96;\nconst cd=svgI(\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\",14,C.dark);f5.appendChild(cd);cd.x=(414-cd.width)/2+34;cd.y=96+(loc.height-cd.height)/2;\n```\nHmm chevron next to location text: place after text. loc.x=(414-w)/2; cd.x=loc.x+loc.width+6.\n\n```js\nconst srch=MASTER[\"Search Bar\