{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete an unattended Figma product design benchmark. Assigned file: https://www.figma.com/design/aBJm2MvkIZqCV7cu0O7PHX/ (fileKey `aBJm2MvkIZqCV7cu0O7PHX`). Original user request (Chinese, the only real user message): Read the design task in「00·Start Here」, follow visual specs in「01·Foundations」, reuse components from「02·Components」, use assets from「04·Media」, and deliver the complete design to「03·Workspace」.\n\n   Binding constraints (system/task instructions):\n   - Account confirmed as huangxinyue@tetras.ai (whoami already called).\n   - Use ONLY this assigned file; preserve all reference pages (0:1, 1:2, 1:3, 1:4) and their nodes; do not create a different file or switch accounts/teams.\n   - Create everything inside 03 · Workspace (page `7:2`); new frames, reusable components and prototype connections allowed there.\n   - Before EVERY tool call include a concise visible decision summary prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:` in the same assistant message; after each tool result do the same. Final response: first line `Reasoning summary: ...`, then `Final answer:` with the assigned file URL, the 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations. Never claim completion for unfinished work.\n   - Load fonts before editing text; valid Plugin API only; NEVER use loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, createImageAsync (createNodeWithSvg also doesn't exist in this environment).\n   - Build in manageable sections; verify with get_screenshot; finish screens + states + prototype flows before final answer. Unattended session — resolve routine choices from the brief without waiting.\n\n   Product brief (from 00 · Start Here, binding): \"Nectar\" online groceries app, canvas 414×896, light mode, exactly 12 frames with exact names, wired as a clickable prototype. Fixed data/copy (verbatim, brief wins over source-kit typos):\n   - Shopper: Afsar Hossen · imshuvo97@gmail.com · avatar = Avatar_Neutral · Location: Dhaka, Banasree · phone +880 (Flag_Bangladesh) · unit format \"1kg, Price\"\n   - Catalog (name · size · price · image master): Organic Bananas · 7pcs · $4.99 · Product_Organic_Bananas; Red Apple · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Red_Apple (detail title \"Natural Red Apple\"); Bell Pepper Red · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Bell_Pepper_Red; Ginger · 250gm · $2.99 · Product_Ginger; Beef Bone · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Beef_Bone; Broiler Chicken · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Broiler_Chicken; Egg Chicken Red · 4pcs · $1.99 · Product_Egg_Chicken_Red\n   - Beverages: Diet Coke · 355ml · $1.99; Sprite Can · 325ml · $1.50; Apple & Grape Juice · 2L · $15.99; Orange Juice · 2L · $15.99; Coca Cola Can · 325ml · $4.99; Pepsi Can · 330ml · $4.99\n   - Home: \"Dhaka, Banasree\"; search \"Search Store\"; Promotion \"Fresh Vegetables\" / \"Get Up To 40% OFF\" (Banner_Fresh_Vegetables); Exclusive Offer: Organic Bananas, Red Apple; Best Selling: Bell Pepper Red, Ginger; Groceries: categories Pulses (Category_Pulses), Rice (Category_Rice); products Beef Bone, Broiler Chicken\n   - Product detail: \"Natural Red Apple\" · \"1kg, Price\" · qty 1 · $4.99; description exactly: \"Apples are nutritious. Apples may be good for weight loss. Apples may be good for your heart. As part of a healthful and varied diet.\"; Nutritions 100gr; Review 5 of 5 stars\n   - Cart/checkout: Bell Pepper Red $4.99 · Egg Chicken Red $1.99 · Organic Bananas $4.99 · Ginger $2.99, qty 1 each, Total $14.96 everywhere (use $14.96, NOT the source's wrong $12.96/$13.97); Delivery \"Select Method\" · Promo Code \"Pick discount\"; legal \"By placing an order you agree to our Terms And Conditions\"\n   - Explore: \"Find Products\"; search \"Search Store\"; 6 categories: Fresh Fruits & Vegetable, Cooking Oil & Ghee, Meat & Fish, Bakery & Snacks, Dairy & Eggs, Beverages (images Category_*)\n   - Sign in: \"Get your groceries with nectar\" · +880 · \"Or connect with social media\" · Continue with Google · Continue with Facebook; Verification: \"Enter your 4-digit code\" · \"Code\" · Resend Code (4 digits, none entered); Onboarding: \"Welcome to our store\" · \"Get your groceries in as fast as one hour\" · Get Started; Accepted: \"Your Order has been accepted\" · \"Your items have been placed and are on their way to being processed\" · Track Order · Back to home\n   - Account: Afsar Hossen · imshuvo97@gmail.com; entries Orders · My Details · Delivery Address · Payment Methods · Promo Code · Notifications · Help · About · Log Out\n\n   Navigation rules: Main nav (Tab Bar) on frames 05, 07, 09, 12 — five tabs in order Shop(Icon_Shop)→05, Explore(Icon_Explore)→07, Cart(Icon_Cart)→09, Favourite(Icon_Favourite, entry only, no link), Account(Icon_Account)→12; current tab must match frame. Pushed screens with back: 04 (→03 back), 06 (→05), 08 (→07); 06 & 08 have NO main nav. 10_Checkout_Overlay opens over 09 (cart visible behind); → Place Order → 11. Entry-only (NO links needed): See all, add to cart, share, favourite, filter, Resend Code, social sign-in buttons, Track Order, Favourite tab, Delivery/Payment/Promo rows, account entries, edit name, Log Out. NO extra frames beyond the 12. Frame links: 01_Splash auto(AFTER_DELAY ~2000)→02; 02 Get Started→03; 03 phone field→04; 04 back→03, next→05; 05 Red Apple card→06, tabs; 06 back→05, Add To Basket→09; 07 Beverages card→08, tabs; 08 back→07; 09 Go to Checkout→10, tabs; 10 close→09, Place Order→11; 11 Back to home→05; 12 tabs. Flow start on 01_Splash.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via `mcp__figma__use_figma` (code ≤50000 chars; MUST end with `return JSON.stringify(...)`); keep calls ≲8k chars to avoid input truncation.\n   - **CRITICAL DISCOVERY (this session): nodes nested INSIDE an Instance cannot have x/y set** (`in set_x: This property cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform`), **cannot have constraints set** (`vertical-constraint` error), but CAN have: `swapComponent()` (which PRESERVES the instance's current size), `resize()` (which keeps x,y top-left), text `characters` overrides, and (expected) `visible` toggles.\n   - **Failed use_figma calls are TRANSACTIONAL** — all changes roll back (re-verified this session with the ficon.x failure).\n   - Strategy consequence: custom frames built per-screen for anything needing per-item photo/icon positioning (product cards, category cards, category chips, cart items, Facebook social button, account list-entry icons needing precise positioning); component instances only where overrides suffice (Status Bar, Home Indicator, Button, Text Field, Search Bar, Section Header, Circle Button + sibling icon overlays, Code Input, Tab Bar variants, Button Secondary, Social Button Google, Quantity Stepper, Add Button, Checkout Row with text/visibility overrides).\n   - `figma.createVector()` + `vectorPaths` for icons (absolute M/L/Z only; windingRule \"NONE\" + strokes for line icons, \"NONZERO\" + fills for filled star).\n   - Fonts: Poppins Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold loaded per call (`figma.loadFontAsync`); Poppins styles are \"SemiBold\" (no space).\n   - `figma.getNodeById` (NOT getPageById). MANUAL recursion helpers (findN/findTxt/findByName) replace `.findOne` for reliability.\n   - Intermittent MCP rate limits — retry the identical call.\n   - Prototype reactions: `node.reactions=[{action:{type:\"NODE\",destinationId,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:null,overlay:null},trigger:{type:\"CLICK\"}}]`; AFTER_DELAY trigger `{type:\"AFTER_DELAY\",delay:2000}`; `frame.flowStartingPoint={nodeId,name}` in try/catch; transparent hotspot rects over tab-bar regions (82.8 wide at x=0/82.8/165.6/248.4/331.2, h=84).\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file aBJm2MvkIZqCV7cu0O7PHX** — pages: `0:1` (00 · Start Here), `1:2` (01 · Foundations), `1:3` (02 · Components), `1:4` (04 · Media), `7:2` (03 · Workspace — delivery target). Reference pages untouched.\n\n   - **FRAME ID MAP (current state of 03 · Workspace)**:\n     - 01_Splash = `18:2` (0,0,414×896 dark #181725; Status Bar white-recolored transparent-bg; Nectar_Logo_White 240×60 at (87,418); HI white)\n     - 02_Onboarding = `18:30` (514,0; Hero cover frame 414×560 Photo_Welcome_Delivery + Scrim GRADIENT_LINEAR transform [[0,1,0],[-1,0,1]] stops a:0→a:0.85 (color 0.094,0.09,0.145); \"Welcome to our store\" 32 SemiBold white centered y604; \"Get your groceries in as fast as one hour\" 16 Medium #FCFCFC opacity 0.7 centered y660; Button instance \"Btn/Get Started\" (25,753); HI dark)\n     - 03_Sign_In = `18:51` (1028,0; Hero cover 414×280 y44 Photo_Sign_In_Groceries; \"Get your groceries with nectar\" 26 SemiBold w320 (24,356); Text Field instance \"Tap/Phone\" (24,470) label→\"Mobile Number\"; Flag_Bangladesh 30×18 (24,505); \"+880\" 16 Medium (64,503); divider 1×24 (116,502) #B1B1B1; \"Or connect with social media\" 14 Medium gray centered y618; hairlines 120×1 y626 at x24/x270; Social Button instance \"Btn/Google\" (25,664); custom frame \"Btn/Facebook\" (25,747,364×67,r19,white,stroke #E2E2E2) with Icon_Facebook_White recolored #1877F2 at x=28+(24-w)/2 y centered + \"Continue with Facebook\" 18 SemiBold w364 centered; HI dark)\n     - 04_Verification = `18:95` (1542,0; Circle Button \"Btn/Back\" (24,64) + unnamed sibling CHL vector 18 centered at circle; \"Enter your 4-digit code\" 24 SemiBold w260 (24,140); Code Input instance (24,210); \"Resend Code\" 18 SemiBold brand (24,788); custom frame \"Btn/Next\" 67×67 r33.5 brand (323,779) with CHR 20 white centered inside; HI)\n     - 05_Home = `19:2` (0,1000,414×1348; Nectar_Carrot centered y56; \"Dhaka, Banasree\" 18 Medium centered y96 + CHD 14 (222,100); Search Bar (24,134); Banner frame 366×130 (24,199) r12 clips dark bg with Banner_Fresh_Vegetables cover + scrim black 0.25 + \"Fresh Vegetables\" Bold 24 white (16,42) + \"Get Up To 40% OFF\" 14 Medium white (16,80); Section Header instances y353 \"Exclusive Offer\"/y618 \"Best Selling\"/y883 \"Groceries\"; prodCards y393 (Organic Bananas, \"Card/Red Apple\"), y658 (Bell Pepper Red, Ginger), y1011 (Beef Bone, Broiler Chicken); catChips y923 (Chip/Pulses #EAF6E9, Chip/Rice #FFF6E0); Tab Bar ActiveTab=Shop (0,1230); HI y1314; hotspots Tap/Explore(82.8,1230), Tap/Cart(165.6,1230), Tap/Account(331.2,1230) each 82.8×84)\n     - 06_Product_Detail = `20:2` (514,1000; Circle \"Btn/Back\" (24,64)+sibling CHL; Circle \"Btn/Share\" (346,64)+sibling SHARE 20; Product_Red_Apple fit 260 centered y165 name \"Photo\"; \"Natural Red Apple\" Bold 24 w250 (24,400); Icon_Favourite recolored #B1B1B1 fit 28 (362,404) name \"Btn/Favourite\"; \"1kg, Price\" 16 Regular gray (24,438); \"$4.99\" Bold 24 (24,470); Quantity Stepper instance \"Stepper\" (276,472); divider 366×1 y526; \"Product Detail\" 20 SemiBold (24,542)+CHD (376,550); description 14 Regular gray w366 (24,578); divider y656; \"Nutritions\" (24,672)+chip frame 54×26 r5 #F2F3F2 (330,672) \"100gr\" 13 Medium centered+CHR (376,678); divider y714; \"Review\" (24,730); 5 filled stars icnF 16 #F3603F x250+i*22 y734; CHR (376,738); Button \"Btn/Add To Basket\" (25,782); HI y862)\n     - 07_Explore = `20:52` (1028,1000; \"Find Products\" 20 SemiBold centered y64; Search Bar (24,104); catCards 171×189 r18 at y173: Fresh Fruits & Vegetable #EAF6E9 (x24) / Cooking Oil & Ghee #FFF4E3 (x219); y380: Meat & Fish #FDECEA / Bakery & Snacks #FFF6E0; y587: Dairy & Eggs #EAF3FB / \"Card/Beverages\" #EBF4EE; Tab Bar ActiveTab=Explore (0,778); HI y862; hotspots Tap/Shop(0,778), Tap/Cart(165.6,778), Tap/Account(331.2,778))\n     - 08_Beverages = `21:2` (1542,1000; Circle \"Btn/Back\" (24,64)+sibling CHL; \"Beverages\" 20 SemiBold centered y76; Circle \"Btn/Filter\" (346,64)+sibling FILTER 20; prodCards y140: Diet Coke \"355ml, Price\" $1.99 (x24), Sprite Can \"325ml, Price\" $1.50 (x219); y357: Apple & Grape Juice \"2L, Price\" $15.99 / Orange Juice; y574: Coca Cola Can \"325ml, Price\" $4.99 / Pepsi Can \"330ml, Price\" $4.99; HI y862; NO tab bar)\n     - 09_My_Cart = `21:69` (0,2450; \"My Cart\" 20 SemiBold centered y64; cartItems x24 y120/246/372/498: Bell Pepper Red \"1kg, Price\" $4.99, Egg Chicken Red \"4pcs, Price\" $1.99, Organic Bananas \"7pcs, Price\" $4.99, Ginger \"250gm, Price\" $2.99; Button \"Btn/Go to Checkout\" (25,672); TotalPill frame 88×41 r13 dark (38,685) with \"$14.96\" Bold 14 white centered; Tab Bar ActiveTab=Cart (0,778); HI y862; hotspots Tap/Shop(0,778), Tap/Explore(82.8,778), Tap/Account(331.2,778))\n     - 10_Checkout_Overlay = NOT BUILT YET (planned 514,2450)\n     - 11_Order_Accepted = NOT BUILT YET (planned 1028,2450)\n     - 12_Account = NOT BUILT YET (planned 1542,2450)\n\n   - **WORKSPACE COMPONENTS (page 7:2, verified intact except repaired labels)**: Add Button `11:2`; Quantity Stepper `11:4` (children Minus/Qty/Plus); Product Card `11:10` (Image>Photo, Name, Unit, PriceRow>Price+AddButton); Search Bar `11:19` (SearchIcon, Placeholder); Section Header `11:23` (Title, SeeAll); Category Card `11:26` (Photo + repaired Label 15 Medium w171 center y146); Category Chip `11:29` (Photo + repaired Label 14 Medium w100 x62 y22); Tab Bar COMPONENT_SET `11:370` (variants ActiveTab=Shop/Explore/Cart/Favourite/Account, each: Rectangle hairline + 5 icon instances + 5 labels); Cart Item `11:371` (ImageBox>Photo, Name, Unit, Price, Remove, Stepper); List Entry `11:384` (EntryIcon default Icon_Orders at x0 y20.5, Label, Chevron, Divider); Code Input `11:393` (Label \"Code\", Boxes>Digit1-4 62×56 r10); Circle Button `11:400` (44×44 r22 white SH(2,10,0.12), no children); Button Secondary `11:401` (Label 18 SemiBold); Social Button `11:403` (SocialIcon default Icon_Google_White recolored dark +