{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Progress: the schema now validates but demands `actions` (array) instead of `action` (singular). This environment uses the newer Reaction format where each reaction has `actions: [...]` (plural, array of actions) — this matches Figma's newer plugin API for multiple actions per interaction.\n\nSo shape:\n```js\ns.reactions=[{actions:[{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:...,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:null}],trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}}];\n```\nThe action object itself: {type:\"NODE\",destinationId,navigation,transition}. The earlier validation complained only about 'overlay' key and trigger types — so action fields type/destinationId/navigation/transition are right.\n\nFor AFTER_TIMEOUT: trigger {type:\"AFTER_TIMEOUT\",timeout:2000} passed validation (the auto error was the actions/message, not trigger validation — actually the auto error message is the same actions message, meaning trigger+action validated fine and then it hit the actions requirement).\n\nFlow start: no flowStartingPoint property anywhere. This env doesn't support setting flow starting points via plugin API. I'll note it as a limitation (prototype start = first frame manually; in Figma the user can set it in the prototype panel, or the default flow start may already be set — actually Figma auto-uses frames as flow starting points when you present from a selected frame; and by default the FIRST frame on the page... not exactly). I'll note: \"flow starting point not settable via this API; 01_Splash auto-advance reaction is set, so presenting from 01_Splash runs the full flow.\"\n\nHmm wait — actually, maybe there's another approach: `figma.root` or REST. Not available. Accept limitation.\n\nRedo the wiring with actions array.","signature":"a15bd03734f548daa930032b"}],"id":"db727de8-cb75-4788-92c2-75feb449717a","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3eb8a6a-7ab8-425f-a694-fe8d0804e2da","uuid":"e37edd91-72e4-465f-b25d-32353a309c56","timestamp":"2026-10-30T22:12:55.418Z","thinking_duration_ms":8115}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Schema uses `actions` (plural array) instead of `action`. Re-wiring.\n\nReasoning summary: Write call — re-apply all links with reactions as {actions:[{type:\"NODE\",...}],trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}} and splash AFTER_TIMEOUT; report per-link status."}],"id":"db727de8-cb75-4788-92c2-75feb449717a","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3eb8a6a-7ab8-425f-a694-fe8d0804e2da","uuid":"ad909252-7a06-48b5-96d4-53249c0251a4","timestamp":"2026-10-30T22:12:56.460Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_a44969a497f944158c51dff6","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(figma.getNodeById(\"7:2\"));\nconst WS=figma.getNodeById(\"7:2\");\nfunction findN(n,fn){if(fn(n))return n;if(\"children\"in n){for(const k of n.children){const r=findN(k,fn);if(r)return r;}}return null;}\nconst byName={};for(const f of WS.children)if(f.type===\"FRAME\"&&/^\\d{2}_/.test(f.name))byName[f.name]=f;\nconst f1=byName[\"01_Splash\"],f2=byName[\"02_Onboarding\"],f3=byName[\"03_Sign_In\"],f4=byName[\"04_Verification\"],f5=byName[\"05_Home\"],f6=byName[\"06_Product_Detail\"],f7=byName[\"07_Explore\"],f8=byName[\"08_Beverages\"],f9=byName[\"09_My_Cart\"],f10=byName[\"10_Checkout_Overlay\"],f11=byName[\"11_Order_Accepted\"],f12=byName[\"12_Account\"];\nconst R={};function link(srcName,frame,dest,tag){const s=findN(frame,n=>n.name===srcName);if(!s){R[tag]=\"MISSING\";return;}try{s.reactions=[{actions:[{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:dest.id,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:null}],trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}}];R[tag]=\"ok\";}catch(e){R[tag]=\"ERR \"+e.message.slice(0,100);}}\ntry{f1.reactions=[{actions:[{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:f2.id,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:null}],trigger:{type:\"AFTER_TIMEOUT\",timeout:2000}}];R.auto=\"ok\";}catch(e){R.auto=\"ERR \"+e.message.slice(0,150);}\nlink(\"Btn/Get Started\",f2,f3,\"getStarted\");\nlink(\"Tap/Phone\",f3,f4,\"phone\");\nlink(\"Btn/Back\",f4,f3,\"vBack\");\nlink(\"Btn/Next\",f4,f5,\"vNext\");\nlink(\"Card/Red Apple\",f5,f6,\"redApple\");\nlink(\"Tap/Explore\",f5,f7,\"hExplore\");\nlink(\"Tap/Cart\",f5,f9,\"hCart\");\nlink(\"Tap/Account\",f5,f12,\"hAccount\");\nlink(\"Btn/Back\",f6,f5,\"pdBack\");\nlink(\"Btn/Add To Basket\",f6,f9,\"addBasket\");\nlink(\"Card/Beverages\",f7,f8,\"bevCard\");\nlink(\"Tap/Shop\",f7,f5,\"eShop\");\nlink(\"Tap/Cart\",f7,f9,\"eCart\");\nlink(\"Tap/Account\",f7,f12,\"eAccount\");\nlink(\"Btn/Back\",f8,f7,\"bevBack\");\nlink(\"Btn/Go to Checkout\",f9,f10,\"checkout\");\nlink(\"Tap/Shop\",f9,f5,\"cShop\");\nlink(\"Tap/Explore\",f9,f7,\"cExplore\");\nlink(\"Tap/Account\",f9,f12,\"cAccount\");\nlink(\"Btn/Close\",f10,f9,\"oClose\");\nlink(\"Btn/Place Order\",f10,f11,\"placeOrder\");\nlink(\"Btn/Back to home\",f11,f5,\"backHome\");\nlink(\"Tap/Shop\",f12,f5,\"aShop\");\nlink(\"Tap/Explore\",f12,f7,\"aExplore\");\nlink(\"Tap/Cart\",f12,f9,\"aCart\");\nreturn JSON.stringify(R);","description":"Wire prototype reactions using actions array schema","fileKey":"aBJm2MvkIZqCV7cu0O7PHX"}}],"id":"db727de8-cb75-4788-92c2-75feb449717a","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3eb8a6a-7ab8-425f-a694-fe8d0804e2da","uuid":"b6f18852-b802-4090-b30c-ae0fb39a2ca6","timestamp":"2026-10-30T22:13:03.787Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_a44969a497f944158c51dff6","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
